<!DOCTYPE concept PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Concept//EN" "concept.dtd">
<concept id="XAuthorforExcelRuntimeFunctionsSwitchConnection" xml:lang="en">
   <title>Switch Connection</title>
   <conbody>
      <p>To connect to your environment from X-Author for Excel at Runtime</p>
      <p/>
      <ol>
         <li>Click <uicontrol>Connect</uicontrol> to display the <uicontrol>Manage Connections</uicontrol> window.</li>
         <li>Under the <uicontrol>Create a new connection section</uicontrol> and in the <uicontrol>Name</uicontrol> field, enter the user name.
               <p>
               <image placement="inline" href="../attachments/98667731/98667981.png"/>
            </p>
         </li>
         <li>In the <uicontrol>Login URL</uicontrol>, add the URL. </li>
         <li>Click <uicontrol>Authorize</uicontrol>.</li>
         <li>Open an App.</li>
      </ol>
   </conbody>
</concept>
